        <briefdescription>
<para>Publish a point-in-time snapshot of all per-plugin metrics to sink. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Iterate all plugins tracked by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1plugins_1_1_plugin_metrics" kindref="compound">PluginMetrics</ref> and emit each stat as a labelled gauge into <computeroutput>sink</computeroutput>. All values are absolute snapshots; the caller is responsible for invoking this at a suitable scrape interval.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
